    "detailed_description": "It's only about you, bow and infinity.<br><br>BullyBall is a VR shooting range game, where your only aim is to shot balls and your only tool is a bow. Though balls are smart enough to constantly keep you in tension, so you need a strong arm to reciprocate. Be flexible in your tactics and reach the top of the Leaderboard!<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your thrusted Bow that you can't get rid of<br></li><li>Endless Arrows with no reload<br></li><li>Enemies have 8 different base behaviors without any limitations of how they can be combined. Discover all the impossible enemies you can think about and can't get through...<br></li><li>Endless waves of enemies, which are evolutionary evolving based on how you play<br></li><li>, and just a few HP to check if you're ambitious enough to stand against infinity</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "It's only about you, bow and infinity.<br><br>BullyBall is a VR shooting range game, where your only aim is to shot balls and your only tool is a bow. Though balls are smart enough to constantly keep you in tension, so you need a strong arm to reciprocate. Be flexible in your tactics and reach the top of the Leaderboard!<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Your thrusted Bow that you can't get rid of<br></li><li>Endless Arrows with no reload<br></li><li>Enemies have 8 different base behaviors without any limitations of how they can be combined. Discover all the impossible enemies you can think about and can't get through...<br></li><li>Endless waves of enemies, which are evolutionary evolving based on how you play<br></li><li>, and just a few HP to check if you're ambitious enough to stand against infinity</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "How long can you stand against evolution itself? Grab the bow, shot'em all. As long as you can. But whatever your strategy is - it can't withstand in a skirmish against endlessly evolving sets of balls. Can't it?",
